        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana PPH3515/DP2576 Solid Brass Pull Plate 3-1/2\" Wide x 15\" High With 8\" Solid Brass Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Commercial Door Pull Plate with 8 Inch Pull is perfect for any high-traffic installation. It is  common size door pull plate primarily used in restaurants, warehouses, restrooms, and stores. The plate is 3-1/2 inches wide and 15 inches long; and is made of solid brass for longevity. The grip is 8 inches long and includes decorative rosettes that can be used or left off. Packaged with matching finish mounting screws for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Matching <a href=\"/products/push-plate-3-5-x-15-inches-solid-brass-deltana-pp3515\"><b>3-1/2\" x 15\" Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana PPH3515/DP2576 Commercial Pull Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 1.2mm</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length: 8-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length Including Rosettes: 9-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Mounting Centers: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosettes Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DP2576PPH-Specifications.pdf?v=1691095347\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  PPH3515/DP2576 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
